--- !u!114 &116247823
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 116247817}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 57715578185bd4242ab60fd22d25faf7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CombatDialogue
  Dialogues:
  - Lines:
    - Content: Combat0
      Name: Content0
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bbf768734d5132e4881bbcf9434d3207, type: 3}
    - Content: Content 0 Line 1 works too
      Name: Line1
      Avatar: {fileID: 2630107354086667377, guid: 44b3c9f2cbc069442aa95d686d1be39b, type: 3}
    - Content: That's craaaazy
      Name: Content0
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bbf768734d5132e4881bbcf9434d3207, type: 3}
  - Lines:
    - Content: State your purpose. Time is a resource I do not waste !
      Name: Omri
      Avatar: {fileID: 2511148379863632921, guid: d194490012f6e1942811d923ac27d60d, type: 3}
    - Content: Huh?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: Everything has a cost. Even life, especially life!
      Name: Omri
      Avatar: {fileID: 2511148379863632921, guid: d194490012f6e1942811d923ac27d60d, type: 3}
    - Content: Then send me the bill or something, let me through !
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: You misunderstand. You are the payment.
      Name: Omri
      Avatar: {fileID: 8592307071887775603, guid: cf79ce4947617ce4fa609e9f3268a21c, type: 3}
    - Content: Oh ? Am I supposed to be...flattered ?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4517582b12c2d6b40a9fbcdb18889ecf, type: 3}
    - Content: Keep going and I'll do to you what the mask did to those mechanics.
      Name: Omri
      Avatar: {fileID: 8592307071887775603, guid: cf79ce4947617ce4fa609e9f3268a21c, type: 3}
    - Content: Nice reference, but you can keep them pipes to yourself.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4517582b12c2d6b40a9fbcdb18889ecf, type: 3}
    - Content: Let's just duel instead.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
  - Lines:
    - Content: a little bit of this..then I guess this would work if I...
      Name: Omar
      Avatar: {fileID: 4856391530043847218, guid: 2e95713182548384ea8323d362045757, type: 3}
    - Content: (A doctor in this place ? He seems busy, let's go while he's not looking.)
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: Do you think I didn't see you ? Bouchta's prime powers maxed out my
        perception skills.
      Name: Omar
      Avatar: {fileID: 2408433479190029688, guid: 6b638bb9bb4aebc4b990c41308fafe8e, type: 3}
    - Content: Prime powers ? What are you talking about ?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: You just rolled a poor nat 1 in stealth my boy now come back here
        and fight me !
      Name: Omar
      Avatar: {fileID: 7487722197439553475, guid: b93317fb6fe50cf419759493d8c7a1a0, type: 3}
    - Content: You got it !
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
  - Lines:
    - Content: "You shouldn\u2019t have come."
      Name: Le D
      Avatar: {fileID: 6751513010459366182, guid: 279fb1430cd719847b98fadc83af0178, type: 3}
    - Content: "No\u2014stay! This will be entertaining"
      Name: La D
      Avatar: {fileID: 4128606575159468467, guid: f2ca51869d2993f44a7e96c48b5a26d6, type: 3}
    - Content: Who exactly am I speaking to?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: "A friend\u2026 once."
      Name: Le D
      Avatar: {fileID: 6751513010459366182, guid: 279fb1430cd719847b98fadc83af0178, type: 3}
    - Content: "A weapon\u2026 now!"
      Name: La D
      Avatar: {fileID: 4128606575159468467, guid: f2ca51869d2993f44a7e96c48b5a26d6, type: 3}
    - Content: "Then I\u2019ll treat you like both."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: YES ! LET's GOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOoooo
      Name: La D
      Avatar: {fileID: 4128606575159468467, guid: f2ca51869d2993f44a7e96c48b5a26d6, type: 3}
  - Lines:
    - Content: YOU. FIGHT. NOW.
      Name: Amine
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: Hello to you too.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: NO TALK. ONLY BATTLE.
      Name: Amine
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: You don't waste time huh ?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: BALLING. BLOOD. BATTLE. VICTORY!
      Name: Amine
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "I\u2019m starting to see a pattern."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: 'ENOUGH! '
      Name: Amine
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "Alright, alright\u2014message received."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
  - Lines:
    - Content: "Yeah Alfonso, I\u2019m about to destroy him\u2014wait, hold on."
      Name: Adam
      Avatar: {fileID: -7786399237539271384, guid: e10a63a496448cb4ab833fe9cdc5dc58, type: 3}
    - Content: Should I come back later?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: Silence! You stand before a disciple of Player 7!
      Name: Adam
      Avatar: {fileID: 4713726622891264198, guid: 5435756b3854b9d4cb9e5080f4b4bd01, type: 3}
    - Content: Player 7, what are you some sort of fan boy ?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4517582b12c2d6b40a9fbcdb18889ecf, type: 3}
    - Content: He inspires me... With the grace of the king, I can now make my hero
        proud..
      Name: Adam
      Avatar: {fileID: 4713726622891264198, guid: 5435756b3854b9d4cb9e5080f4b4bd01, type: 3}
    - Content: And if that admiration destroys you?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: "\u2026Then it was worth it."
      Name: Adam
      Avatar: {fileID: 4713726622891264198, guid: 5435756b3854b9d4cb9e5080f4b4bd01, type: 3}
  - Lines:
    - Content: "Peace be upon you\u2026 though peace has long left this place."
      Name: Reda
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "You don\u2019t sound like the others."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: I remember what we were. That is my burden.
      Name: Reda
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: Then you know this must end.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "Yes\u2026 but I will not give up this easily."
      Name: Reda
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: I won't either !
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: He was once good you know. I want to believe there is still some light
        within *Him*
      Name: Reda
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "\u2026May your light be stronger than his darkness."
      Name: Reda
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
  - Lines:
    - Content: I guess you're next show me what you got !
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "\u2026"
      Name: O
      Avatar: {fileID: -4935250693920927086, guid: e1fbeddc956bdb44992f101500560ad7, type: 3}
    - Content: No witty comment like the others ?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4517582b12c2d6b40a9fbcdb18889ecf, type: 3}
    - Content: ...
      Name: O
      Avatar: {fileID: -4935250693920927086, guid: e1fbeddc956bdb44992f101500560ad7, type: 3}
    - Content: "You don\u2019t...speak..?"
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: '**slow nod**'
      Name: O
      Avatar: {fileID: -4935250693920927086, guid: e1fbeddc956bdb44992f101500560ad7, type: 3}
    - Content: Maybe you'll listen to reason then, we don't have to fight !
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: '**draws weapon**'
      Name: O
      Avatar: {fileID: -3494014149633077478, guid: 95d51577ec1ea1248900fa436e226aeb, type: 3}
    - Content: ...
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: ... I get it
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
  - Lines:
    - Content: You should not be here.
      Name: Thiboyer
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: I hear that a lot.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4517582b12c2d6b40a9fbcdb18889ecf, type: 3}
    - Content: I do not wish to fight.
      Name: Thiboyer
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: But you will find a reason won't you ?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4517582b12c2d6b40a9fbcdb18889ecf, type: 3}
    - Content: "I swore to protect him\u2026 no matter what he became."
      Name: Thiboyer
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: Even if he is not himself anymore ?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: "\u2026Especially then."
      Name: Thiboyer
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
  - Lines:
    - Content: "You have come far\u2026 farther than most who dared enter this place."
      Name: La Mama
      Avatar: {fileID: 9007189993209018080, guid: 85905dad6650db64fa6deed1928417ce, type: 3}
    - Content: Far enough to finish this.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "Finish\u2026? No. You do not understand what waits beyond."
      Name: La Mama
      Avatar: {fileID: -767042309513428199, guid: 5251bf7670f8505449a5e85d61da0583, type: 3}
    - Content: Then help me understand.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "He was my firstborn. Before the crown, the prime, the curse\u2026
        he was just my son."
      Name: La Mama
      Avatar: {fileID: -767042309513428199, guid: 5251bf7670f8505449a5e85d61da0583, type: 3}
    - Content: Bouchta?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: Yes. But some sort of devil corrupted him, it was too much. No soul
        could carry that burden alone, that curse...
      Name: La Mama
      Avatar: {fileID: -767042309513428199, guid: 5251bf7670f8505449a5e85d61da0583, type: 3}
    - Content: So you took it from him.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: "I shared it. I broke it, scattered it\u2026 so he would not be consumed
        entirely."
      Name: La Mama
      Avatar: {fileID: -767042309513428199, guid: 5251bf7670f8505449a5e85d61da0583, type: 3}
    - Content: And it changed you.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: "It made me what I was always meant to be\u2026 a mother who protects."
      Name: La Mama
      Avatar: {fileID: -767042309513428199, guid: 5251bf7670f8505449a5e85d61da0583, type: 3}
    - Content: Even now?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: Especially now.
      Name: La Mama
      Avatar: {fileID: -767042309513428199, guid: 5251bf7670f8505449a5e85d61da0583, type: 3}
    - Content: "He\u2019s suffering, and he is hurting a lot of people too, I cannot
        let him get away with it."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "\u2026I know."
      Name: La Mama
      Avatar: {fileID: -767042309513428199, guid: 5251bf7670f8505449a5e85d61da0583, type: 3}
    - Content: Then let me end it.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: Many believed they could. None were strong enough.
      Name: La Mama
      Avatar: {fileID: -767042309513428199, guid: 5251bf7670f8505449a5e85d61da0583, type: 3}
    - Content: Let me try at least, you don't know what I'm capable of !
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "I will test you\u2026 not as his mother, but as his guardian."
      Name: La Mama
      Avatar: {fileID: 9007189993209018080, guid: 85905dad6650db64fa6deed1928417ce, type: 3}
    - Content: "I won\u2019t hold back."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "Good. Because I will not let you pass\u2026 unless you prove you
        can save him."
      Name: La Mama
      Avatar: {fileID: 9007189993209018080, guid: 85905dad6650db64fa6deed1928417ce, type: 3}
  - Lines:
    - Content: "Stop. Whatever you think you\u2019re here to do\u2026 let it go."
      Name: Sara
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "I\u2019m not turning back."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "Then understand this first\u2014you cannot save him."
      Name: Sara
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: People seem to disagree on this.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: Well it's true, you cannot help him.
      Name: Sara
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "There\u2019s always a way."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: Yes, but you're not it. If he wants to move on he needs to do it himself.
      Name: La Mama
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "You\u2019ve given up on him?"
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: No. I believe in him more than anyone. But He chose this path.
      Name: Sara
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "No one chooses to become\u2026 that."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: He chose to carry everything. For us. For this kingdom. For people
        like me.
      Name: Sara
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "And now he\u2019s lost because of it."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: "No. Now he\u2019s exactly where that choice led him."
      Name: Sara
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "Then I\u2019ll pull him out of it."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "You can\u2019t. Strength won\u2019t reach him. Words won\u2019t reach
        him."
      Name: Sara
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: Then what will?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: Time. Consequence. Himself.
      Name: Sara
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "\u2026And until then?"
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: I believe in him, he will come to his senses. No one interferes.
      Name: Sara
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: Then I guess there is no changing your mind..
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: If you truly wanted to save him, you'd let his loved ones save him.
      Name: Sara
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: You...won't...bother us...anymore
      Name: Unkown
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
  - Lines:
    - Content: Careful what you say next. His name is not yours to stain.
      Name: Rhita
      Avatar: {fileID: 823831621719853587, guid: 6618328ae6b46a34aae76951021567d7, type: 3}
    - Content: "I\u2019ve heard enough to know what he\u2019s become."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "Then you\u2019ve heard lies."
      Name: Rhita
      Avatar: {fileID: -7777597809696197703, guid: 428412fb0aae8a64a8abe6faf8dd926a, type: 3}
    - Content: "An entire kingdom doesn\u2019t fall to lies."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: It falls to weakness, and he was stronger than all of us.
      Name: Rhita
      Avatar: {fileID: -7777597809696197703, guid: 428412fb0aae8a64a8abe6faf8dd926a, type: 3}
    - Content: You call this strength?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: I call it resolve.
      Name: Rhita
      Avatar: {fileID: -7777597809696197703, guid: 428412fb0aae8a64a8abe6faf8dd926a, type: 3}
    - Content: "He\u2019s tearing everything apart."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "He\u2019s rebuilding a whole kingdom. You just don\u2019t understand
        the cost."
      Name: Rhita
      Avatar: {fileID: 823831621719853587, guid: 6618328ae6b46a34aae76951021567d7, type: 3}
    - Content: And you do?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4517582b12c2d6b40a9fbcdb18889ecf, type: 3}
    - Content: He taught me everything I am. Discipline. Precision. Pride.
      Name: Rhita
      Avatar: {fileID: -7777597809696197703, guid: 428412fb0aae8a64a8abe6faf8dd926a, type: 3}
    - Content: "Then you know this isn\u2019t who he was."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: This is exactly who he was meant to be.
      Name: Rhita
      Avatar: {fileID: 823831621719853587, guid: 6618328ae6b46a34aae76951021567d7, type: 3}
    - Content: "\u2026You really believe that."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: I do.
      Name: Rhita
      Avatar: {fileID: -7777597809696197703, guid: 428412fb0aae8a64a8abe6faf8dd926a, type: 3}
    - Content: People are calling him mad.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: "\u2026Say that again."
      Name: Rhita
      Avatar: {fileID: 823831621719853587, guid: 6618328ae6b46a34aae76951021567d7, type: 3}
    - Content: You heard me.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: Who are you to him anyway to defend him like that?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: I am the blade that answers to disrespect, you don't know the value
        of my brother and you will perish in your arrogance !
      Name: Rhita
      Avatar: {fileID: 823831621719853587, guid: 6618328ae6b46a34aae76951021567d7, type: 3}
  - Lines:
    - Content: "Sit\u2026 just for a moment."
      Name: El Padre
      Avatar: {fileID: -5098830139293016519, guid: 3dea7a2145f1c284c93349ddcf49e913, type: 3}
    - Content: "\u2026You\u2019re not attacking?"
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: "If I wished you dead, we wouldn\u2019t be speaking."
      Name: El Padre
      Avatar: {fileID: -5098830139293016519, guid: 3dea7a2145f1c284c93349ddcf49e913, type: 3}
    - Content: Fair enough.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4517582b12c2d6b40a9fbcdb18889ecf, type: 3}
    - Content: "Tell me\u2026 what do you see when you think of him?"
      Name: El Padre
      Avatar: {fileID: -5098830139293016519, guid: 3dea7a2145f1c284c93349ddcf49e913, type: 3}
    - Content: A king who lost his way.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: Hmm.
      Name: El Padre
      Avatar: {fileID: -5098830139293016519, guid: 3dea7a2145f1c284c93349ddcf49e913, type: 3}
    - Content: You disagree.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: "I think you\u2019re looking for something to blame."
      Name: El Padre
      Avatar: {fileID: -5098830139293016519, guid: 3dea7a2145f1c284c93349ddcf49e913, type: 3}
    - Content: "Isn\u2019t that what this is?"
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4517582b12c2d6b40a9fbcdb18889ecf, type: 3}
    - Content: That is the part you see.
      Name: El Padre
      Avatar: {fileID: -5098830139293016519, guid: 3dea7a2145f1c284c93349ddcf49e913, type: 3}
    - Content: What part am I missing?
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4517582b12c2d6b40a9fbcdb18889ecf, type: 3}
    - Content: "The sacrifices. The choices no one noticed. The moments where he
        stood alone\u2026 and no one stepped forward."
      Name: El Padre
      Avatar: {fileID: -5098830139293016519, guid: 3dea7a2145f1c284c93349ddcf49e913, type: 3}
    - Content: "\u2026You\u2019re saying this could\u2019ve been avoided."
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9350678610c0aa4298d6a7c2f1a377f, type: 3}
    - Content: "I\u2019m saying he wasn\u2019t stopped, it should have been me..."
      Name: Rhita
      Avatar: {fileID: -5098830139293016519, guid: 3dea7a2145f1c284c93349ddcf49e913, type: 3}
    - Content: Would it matter you or him a tyrant would be born. You didn't matter
        did you?.
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: Now, I stand with him. As I should have from the beginning.
      Name: El Padre
      Avatar: {fileID: -5098830139293016519, guid: 3dea7a2145f1c284c93349ddcf49e913, type: 3}
    - Content: I hear you, but it's too late now, I'm stopping this madness !
      Name: Traveler
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
    - Content: ...
      Name: El Padre
      Avatar: {fileID: -5098830139293016519, guid: 3dea7a2145f1c284c93349ddcf49e913, type: 3}
    - Content: ...
      Name: El Padre
      Avatar: {fileID: -5098830139293016519, guid: 3dea7a2145f1c284c93349ddcf49e913, type: 3}
    - Content: ...
      Name: El Padre
      Avatar: {fileID: -5098830139293016519, guid: 3dea7a2145f1c284c93349ddcf49e913, type: 3}
    - Content: No you wont.
      Name: El Padre
      Avatar: {fileID: -7868205583407863676, guid: de262dc92570fa04590ee0ccfad7ef73, type: 3}
  - Lines:
    - Content: Bouchta fight
      Name: Bouchta
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
  - Lines:
    - Content: Louriprime
      Name: Louriprime
      Avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312ad9bd6cf4ef445b8a4b3e9865724f, type: 3}
